# Route: guide 12 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 33 to
# 35, 46 quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thunder Bluff, Thousand Needles, Hillsbrad Foothills, Undercity,
# Alterac Mountains): Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff ->
# near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Camp E'thok ->
# Freewind Post -> Darkcloud Pinnacle -> Camp E'thok -> Freewind Post -> The
# Shimmering Flats -> Freewind Post -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen
# Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 3526 Goblin
# Engineering; 3635 Gnome Engineering; 7321 Soothing Turtle Bisque.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing
# an Enemy's Strength (5723), Gahz'rilla (2770), The Grave Knight (96986), The
# Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going, Going, Guano! (1109),
# Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The Power to Destroy...
# (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice (92421), The New Plague
# (95216), Source of Power (96988), Heart of Disruption (96984), The Grave
# Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987).

